   "evidence": "Homotopy.lean:286 `def compRight (h : Homotopy f g) (k : AInfinityHom BB CC)`, :298 `barHomotopy_compRight ... := (rfl)`. Transformation.lean:400/425 define the cochain versions, and no theorem links them to `equivCochains`.",
   "file": "TauCeti/Algebra/Homology/AInfinity/Algebra/Hom/Transformation.lean",
   "fix": "Add `@[simp] Homotopy.equivCochains_compRight : (equivCochains (h.compRight k)).1 = compRight k (-1) (equivCochains h).1` and the `compLeft` analogue, each proved by `Subtype.ext (rfl)`.",
